    "matters": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "[It] should impress his subjects with the insignia and outward magnificence of the greatest imperialism his continent had known.",
        "lead": "Fenollosa, on what Hideyoshi wanted from Eitoku's art:",
